  "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4659334\">.mw-parser-output .infobox{border:1px solid #a2a9b1;color:black;padding:0.2em;font-size:88%;line-height:1.5em;border-spacing:3px}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .infobox{background-color:#f8f9fa;color:var(--color-base-fixed,#202122)}}@media(max-width:640px){.mw-parser-output .infobox{width:100%}.mw-parser-output .infobox .nowrap{white-space:normal}}@media(min-width:640px){.mw-parser-output .infobox{margin:0.5em 0 0.5em 1em;float:right;clear:right;width:22em}}.mw-parser-output .infobox-header,.mw-parser-output .infobox-label,.mw-parser-output .infobox-above,.mw-parser-output .infobox-full-data,.mw-parser-output .infobox-data,.mw-parser-output .infobox-below,.mw-parser-output .infobox-subheader,.mw-parser-output .infobox-image,.mw-parser-output .infobox-navbar,.mw-parser-output .infobox th,.mw-parser-output .infobox td{vertical-align:top}.mw-parser-output .infobox-label,.mw-parser-output .infobox-data,.mw-parser-output .infobox th,.mw-parser-output .infobox td{text-align:left}.mw-parser-output .infobox .infobox-above,.mw-parser-output .infobox .infobox-title,.mw-parser-output .infobox caption{font-size:125%;font-weight:bold;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .infobox-title,.mw-parser-output .infobox caption{padding:0.2em}.mw-parser-output .infobox .infobox-header,.mw-parser-output .infobox .infobox-subheader,.mw-parser-output .infobox .infobox-image,.mw-parser-output .infobox .infobox-full-data,.mw-parser-output .infobox .infobox-below{text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .infobox .infobox-navbar{text-align:right}</style><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4421339\">.mw-parser-output .infobox-subbox{padding:0;border:none;margin:-3px;width:auto;min-width:100%;font-size:100%;clear:none;float:none;background-color:transparent;color:inherit}.mw-parser-output .infobox-3cols-child{margin:auto}.mw-parser-output .infobox .navbar{font-size:100%}body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-header,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-subheader,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-above,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-title,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-image,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-full-data,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-below{text-align:center}</style><table class=\"infobox\" style=\"background-color: #f6f6f6; color:#000000 min-width: 300px; font-size:small; padding: 5px\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-above\" style=\"background-color: #96b9fa; color:inherit; font-size:medium; overflow-wrap: break-word; width:300px;\">1-2-3-4 Cake</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-image\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:1-2-3-4_cake_slice_with_chocolate_sour_cream_icing.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/1-2-3-4_cake_slice_with_chocolate_sour_cream_icing.JPG/330px-1-2-3-4_cake_slice_with_chocolate_sour_cream_icing.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"223\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/1-2-3-4_cake_slice_with_chocolate_sour_cream_icing.JPG/960px-1-2-3-4_cake_slice_with_chocolate_sour_cream_icing.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2304\" data-file-height=\"1712\" /></a></span> </td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Servings</th><td class=\"infobox-data\">8–10</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Time</th><td class=\"infobox-data\">Prep: 20 minutes<br />Baking: 60 minutes</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Difficulty</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><span class=\"metadata\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:2o5dots.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Easy\"><img alt=\"Easy\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/2o5dots.svg/120px-2o5dots.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/2o5dots.svg/250px-2o5dots.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"12\" /></a></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Table_of_Contents\" title=\"Cookbook:Table of Contents\">Cookbook</a> | <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Recipes\" title=\"Cookbook:Recipes\">Recipes</a> | <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Ingredients\" title=\"Cookbook:Ingredients\">Ingredients</a> | <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Equipment\" title=\"Cookbook:Equipment\">Equipment</a> | <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Cooking_Techniques\" title=\"Cookbook:Cooking Techniques\">Techniques</a> | <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Cookbook_disambiguation_pages\" title=\"Category:Cookbook disambiguation pages\">Cookbook Disambiguation Pages</a> | <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Recipes\" title=\"Category:Recipes\">Recipes</a>  <span id=\"displaytitle\" title=\"Recipe\"></span> | <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Cuisine_of_the_United_States\" title=\"Cookbook:Cuisine of the United States\">United States</a> | <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Cake\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cookbook:Cake\">Cake</a>\n</p><p>This is a traditional American recipe for a <b>1-2-3-4 cake</b>, a simple form of yellow <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Cake\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cookbook:Cake\">cake</a>. The name comes from the volumetric ratio of butter to sugar, flour, and eggs.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Ingredients\">Ingredients</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:1-2-3-4_Cake&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Ingredients\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:1-2-3-4_Cake&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Ingredients\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>1 <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Cup\" title=\"Cookbook:Cup\">cup</a> (240 <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Gram\" title=\"Cookbook:Gram\">g</a> / 8.5 <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Ounce\" title=\"Cookbook:Ounce\">oz</a>) <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Butter\" title=\"Cookbook:Butter\">butter</a></li>\n<li>1 cup (240 ml / 8.1 oz) <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Milk\" title=\"Cookbook:Milk\">milk</a></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Teaspoon\" title=\"Cookbook:Teaspoon\">teaspoon</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Vanilla_Extract\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cookbook:Vanilla Extract\">vanilla extract</a></li>\n<li>2 cups (450 g / 16 oz) white granulated <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Sugar\" title=\"Cookbook:Sugar\">sugar</a></li>\n<li>3 cups (400 g / 14 oz) <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:All-purpose_flour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cookbook:All-purpose flour\">all-purpose flour</a></li>\n<li>3 teaspoons <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Baking_Powder\" title=\"Cookbook:Baking Powder\">baking powder</a></li>\n<li>3 <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Pinch\" title=\"Cookbook:Pinch\">pinches</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Salt\" title=\"Cookbook:Salt\">salt</a></li>\n<li>4 <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Egg\" title=\"Cookbook:Egg\">eggs</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Procedure_(brief)\"><span id=\"Procedure_.28brief.29\"></span>Procedure (brief)</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:1-2-3-4_Cake&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Procedure (brief)\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:1-2-3-4_Cake&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Procedure (brief)\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ol><li>Preheat oven to 175 °C (350 °F)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Creaming\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cookbook:Creaming\">Cream</a> the butter and sugar together until fluffy.</li>\n<li>Beat in the vanilla and eggs, one at a time, ensuring the batter is well mixed after each egg.</li>\n<li>Gradually sift in the dry ingredients, alternating with small additions of the milk.</li>\n<li>Transfer to a greased and floured <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Cake_Pan\" title=\"Cookbook:Cake Pan\">baking pan</a>.</li>\n<li>Bake at 175 °C (350 °F), until a skewer inserted shows no moist crumbs.</li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Procedure_(detailed)\"><span id=\"Procedure_.28detailed.29\"></span>Procedure (detailed)</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:1-2-3-4_Cake&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Procedure (detailed)\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:1-2-3-4_Cake&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Procedure (detailed)\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Preparation\">Preparation</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:1-2-3-4_Cake&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Preparation\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:1-2-3-4_Cake&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Preparation\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>You will need these things:\n</p>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-nolines\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:1-2-3-4_Cake_ingredients.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"The ingredients. (Salt not shown here)\"><img alt=\"The ingredients. (Salt not shown here)\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/1-2-3-4_Cake_ingredients.JPG/250px-1-2-3-4_Cake_ingredients.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"134\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/1-2-3-4_Cake_ingredients.JPG/500px-1-2-3-4_Cake_ingredients.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2304\" data-file-height=\"1712\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The ingredients. (Salt not shown here)</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:1-2-3-4_Cake_cooking_implements.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Cooking implements: beaters, large bowl, cup measurement and large cake tin. Scales optional.\"><img alt=\"Cooking implements: beaters, large bowl, cup measurement and large cake tin. Scales optional.\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/1-2-3-4_Cake_cooking_implements.JPG/250px-1-2-3-4_Cake_cooking_implements.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"134\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/1-2-3-4_Cake_cooking_implements.JPG/500px-1-2-3-4_Cake_cooking_implements.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2304\" data-file-height=\"1712\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Cooking implements: beaters, large bowl, cup measurement and large cake tin. Scales optional.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Oven.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"An oven, of course!\"><img alt=\"An oven, of course!\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Oven.jpg/250px-Oven.jpg?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"135\" height=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Oven.jpg/330px-Oven.jpg?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"768\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">An oven, of course!</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Method\">Method</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:1-2-3-4_Cake&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Method\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:1-2-3-4_Cake&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Method\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-nolines\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Oven.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"1. Preheat your oven.\"><img alt=\"1. Preheat your oven.\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Oven.jpg/250px-Oven.jpg?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"135\" height=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Oven.jpg/330px-Oven.jpg?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"768\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">1. Preheat your oven.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Creaming_butter_-_step_1.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"2. Cream the butter and sugar together.\"><img alt=\"2. Cream the butter and sugar together.\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Creaming_butter_-_step_1.JPG/250px-Creaming_butter_-_step_1.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"134\" height=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Creaming_butter_-_step_1.JPG/330px-Creaming_butter_-_step_1.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1712\" data-file-height=\"2304\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">2. <a href=\"/wiki/Cookbook:Creaming\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cookbook:Creaming\">Cream</a> the butter and sugar together.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cracking_an_egg.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"3. Crack the eggs in, and beat them in too\"><img alt=\"3. Crack the eggs in, and beat them in too\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Cracking_an_egg.JPG/250px-Cracking_an_egg.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"134\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Cracking_an_egg.JPG/500px-Cracking_an_egg.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2304\" data-file-height=\"1712\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">3. Crack the eggs in, and beat them in too</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:1-2-3-4_Cake_after_beating_in_eggs.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"After beating in the eggs, it looks like this\"><img alt=\"After beating in the eggs, it looks like this\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/1-2-3-4_Cake_after_beating_in_eggs.JPG/250px-1-2-3-4_Cake_after_beating_in_eggs.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"134\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/1-2-3-4_Cake_after_beating_in_eggs.JPG/500px-1-2-3-4_Cake_after_beating_in_eggs.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2304\" data-file-height=\"1712\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">After beating in the eggs, it looks like this</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Flour_and_milk.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"4. Now get your flour and milk\"><img alt=\"4. Now get your flour and milk\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Flour_and_milk.JPG/250px-Flour_and_milk.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"134\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Flour_and_milk.JPG/500px-Flour_and_milk.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2304\" data-file-height=\"1712\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">4. Now get your flour and milk</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Beating_flour_into_cake_mixture.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"5. Mix a little bit of flour in it.\"><img alt=\"5. Mix a little bit of flour in it.\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Beating_flour_into_cake_mixture.JPG/250px-Beating_flour_into_cake_mixture.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"134\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Beating_flour_into_cake_mixture.JPG/500px-Beating_flour_into_cake_mixture.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2304\" data-file-height=\"1712\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">5. Mix a little bit of flour in it.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Beating_milk_into_cake_mixture.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"6. Then a little bit of milk.\"><img alt=\"6. Then a little bit of milk.\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/Beating_milk_into_cake_mixture.JPG/250px-Beating_milk_into_cake_mixture.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"134\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/Beating_milk_into_cake_mixture.JPG/500px-Beating_milk_into_cake_mixture.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2304\" data-file-height=\"1712\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">6. Then a little bit of milk.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:1-2-3-4_Cake_mixture.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Repeat 5 and 6 until done. By now the mixture will be very smooth.\"><img alt=\"Repeat 5 and 6 until done. By now the mixture will be very smooth.\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4d/1-2-3-4_Cake_mixture.JPG/250px-1-2-3-4_Cake_mixture.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"134\" height=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4d/1-2-3-4_Cake_mixture.JPG/330px-1-2-3-4_Cake_mixture.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1712\" data-file-height=\"2304\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Repeat 5 and 6 until done. By now the mixture will be very smooth.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cake_mixture_in_tin.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"7. Pour the mixture into a greased and floured cake tin, then pop it in the oven\"><img alt=\"7. Pour the mixture into a greased and floured cake tin, then pop it in the oven\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Cake_mixture_in_tin.JPG/250px-Cake_mixture_in_tin.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"134\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Cake_mixture_in_tin.JPG/500px-Cake_mixture_in_tin.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2304\" data-file-height=\"1712\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">7. Pour the mixture into a greased and floured cake tin, then pop it in the oven</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Checking_if_cake_is_done.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"8. Checking if the cake is &quot;done&quot;: put a sharp knife or skewer into the centre of the cake\"><img alt=\"8. Checking if the cake is &quot;done&quot;: put a sharp knife or skewer into the centre of the cake\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Checking_if_cake_is_done.JPG/250px-Checking_if_cake_is_done.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"134\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Checking_if_cake_is_done.JPG/500px-Checking_if_cake_is_done.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2304\" data-file-height=\"1712\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">8. Checking if the cake is \"done\": put a sharp knife or skewer into the centre of the cake</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dirty_knife_from_cake.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"If the knife is dirty - the mixture is still wet - put it back in! (This was after about 15 minutes, it takes a lot longer)\"><img alt=\"If the knife is dirty - the mixture is still wet - put it back in! (This was after about 15 minutes, it takes a lot longer)\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Dirty_knife_from_cake.JPG/250px-Dirty_knife_from_cake.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"134\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Dirty_knife_from_cake.JPG/500px-Dirty_knife_from_cake.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2304\" data-file-height=\"1712\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">If the knife is dirty - the mixture is still wet - put it back in! (This was after about 15 minutes, it takes a lot longer)</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:1-2-3-4_cake.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Finally, it&#39;s done! Notice how brown the top is, due to the high sugar content\"><img alt=\"Finally, it&#39;s done! Notice how brown the top is, due to the high sugar content\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4d/1-2-3-4_cake.JPG/250px-1-2-3-4_cake.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"134\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4d/1-2-3-4_cake.JPG/500px-1-2-3-4_cake.JPG?utm_source=en.wikibooks.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2304\" data-file-height=\"1712\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Finally, it's done! Notice how brown the top is, due to the high sugar content</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐web.codfw.main‐744d458d4c‐wlvvg\nCached time: 20260929091907\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [prevent‐selective‐update, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.109 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 296/1000000\nRevision size: 3464/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 4724/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 554/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 17328/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.011/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 651410/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.741      1 -total\n 86.70%   41.392      1 Template:Recipesummary\n 80.75%   38.552      1 Template:Infobox\n 13.19%    6.295      1 Template:Recipe\n 10.73%    5.121      1 Template:Cookbook_page_type\n  3.92%    1.869      1 Template:Template_other\n  3.03%    1.445      1 Template:Displaytitle\n  2.57%    1.226      1 Template:Cooknav\n-->\n\n<!-- Render ID d247fc83-bbe6-11f1-8df0-a3c82a36ec88 -->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key enwikibooks:pcache:4696:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20260929091907 and revision id 4608393. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>",
